@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### 01 - Rechazar estado desconocido en listado (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments?status=IN_TRANSIT

### 02 - Rechazar limit fuera de rango (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments?limit=101

### 03 - Rechazar size cero (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments?size=0

### 04 - Rechazar parámetros no numéricos (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments?limit=abc&size=first

### 05 - Rechazar creación sin contenedores (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "Buenos Aires, Argentina",
  "destination": "Montevideo, Uruguay",
  "containers": [],
  "documents": [
    { "type": "COMMERCIAL_INVOICE", "reference": "INV-REST-INVALID" },
    { "type": "PACKING_LIST", "reference": "PL-REST-INVALID" }
  ]
}

### 06 - Responder 404 para embarque inexistente (esperado: SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999

### 07 - Rechazar UUID inválido (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/not-a-uuid
